\rem /s1 The Lord's Promises to His People; Restoration of Israel; Promises of Deliverance; Promises of restoration for the people; Restoration Promised for Israel and Judah
\s4 Both kingdoms
\p
\v 1 Yahweh¦318137 \add ≈gave\add* Yirmeyah¦318135 a message¦318130, saying¦318138:
\v 2 Yisrael's¦318145 god¦318144, Yahweh¦318143 says¦318142 this: Write¦318147 down on a scroll all¦318151 the¦318153 messages¦318153 that¦318154 I've¦318156 \add ≈given\add* you¦318157,
\v 3 because¦318162 listen to Yahweh's declaration¦318166: The \add ≈time¦318164\add* is¦318165 coming¦318165 when¦318169 I'll¦318169 restore my¦318173 people¦318173 of¦318173 Yisrael¦318174 and¦318175 Yehudah¦318175 from captivity¦318172, and¦318178 I'll¦318178 bring¦318178 them¦318178 back¦318178 to¦318179 the¦318181 land¦318181 that¦318182 I¦318184 have to¦318185 their¦318185 ancestors¦318185, and¦318186 they'll¦318186 \add ≈take¦318186 possession¦318186 of¦318186 it¦318186\add* \add again\add*.
\p
\v 4 \add ≈Now\add* these¦318189 are¦318190 the¦318190 messages¦318190 that¦318191 Yahweh¦318193 spoke¦318192 concerning¦318194 Yisrael¦318196 and¦318197 Yehudah¦318199:
\q1
\v 5 \add ≈Yes,\add* Yahweh¦318205 says¦318204 this:
\q1 A¦318206 \add ≈cry of¦318206 panic and terror\add* has¦318208 been heard¦318208,
\q1 ≈and¦318210 there's¦318210 no peace¦318211.
\q1
\v 6 Please¦318215 ask¦318213 and¦318216 \add ≈find out\add*: can \add #males¦318220\add* give¦318219 birth¦318219?
\q1 Why¦318221 do I¦318222 see¦318222 every¦318223 strong man¦318225 with his¦318226 hands¦318226 on¦318227 his¦318229 \add ≈hips\add* like¦318230 a woman \add ≈in labour¦318230\add*?
