\q1 ≈and¦318294 don't¦318294 be¦318296 dismayed¦318296, Yisrael¦318297 \add !(Israel¦318297)\add*,
\q1 because¦318298 listen, I'm¦318299 rescuing¦318300 you¦318300 from¦318301 afar,
\q1 and¦318302 your¦318304 offspring from¦318305 the¦318305 land¦318305 \add ≈where they were held captive¦318306\add*.
