\q1 and¦318311 there¦318311 won't¦318311 be¦318311 anyone¦318312 making it afraid.\x + \xo 30:10-11: \xt Jer 46:27-28.\x*
\q1
\v 11 Yahweh¦318320 \add ≈declares¦318318\add*:
