\v 15 “\add Ha,\add* if¦323330 I¦323331 tell¦323331 you the truth, you'll¦323339 order me¦323335 to¦323335 be executed¦323335,” Yirmeyah¦323326 \add ≈replied\add*. “And¦323336 if I¦323337 give you good advice¦323337, you¦323337 won't¦323338 \add ≈take any notice of\add* what I say¦323325.”
