\v 18 But¦323413 if¦323413 you¦323416 don't go¦323416 out¦323416 to¦323417 \add *his¦323421\add* officials, then¦323422 this¦323424 city¦323423 will¦323422 be¦323422 \add ≈handed¦323425 over to the¦323426 Babylonians\add*. They'll¦323427 burn¦323427 it¦323427 \add down\add*, and¦323429 you wouldn't \add be able to\add* escape¦323432 from¦323433 their¦323433 \add ≈power\add*.”
