\v 19 “\add But\add* I'm afraid of the \add ≈Judaneans\add* who've \add already\add* deserted to the Babylonians,” \add *the¦323438 king¦323438\add* \add ≈confided to¦323439\add* Yirmeyah¦323441. “\add ≈You see,\add* I¦323442 might be¦323443 \add ≈handed¦323456 over to¦323449 them\add* and¦323457 they¦323457 \add ≈might treat me¦323459 cruelly\add*.”
