\v 22 Listen¦323492 king¦323499 of¦323499 Yehudah¦323501, all¦323493 the¦323495 women¦323495 who¦323496 are¦323497 left¦323497 in¦323498 your \add ≈palace¦323498\add* will¦323502 be¦323502 taken¦323502 out¦323502 to¦323503 the¦323505 Babylonian king's commanders¦323505. Those women will¦323509 tell¦323509 you,
