\v 14 sent¦323939 out¦323957 men to fetch Yirmeyah¦323943 from¦323944 the¦323944 guards'¦323945 courtyard¦323944. They¦323946 \add ≈handed¦323946 him over¦323946\add* to¦323948 Gedalyah¦323950 (son¦323951 of¦323951 Ahikam¦323953, son¦323954 of¦323954 Shafan¦323956) to¦323957 take¦323957 him¦323957 home¦323960, \add ≈so¦323961\add* \add @Yirmeyah¦323961\add* stayed¦323961 \add there\add* among the¦323963 people¦323963.
