\v 9 then¦325177 he¦325177 told¦325177 them¦325178, “You¦325186 all sent¦325186 me¦325187 to Yisrael's¦325184 god¦325183 Yahweh¦325182 \add ≈to¦325188 pass on your¦325190 requests\add* \add ≈and here's his reply\add*:
