\v 22 \add ≈So¦325473\add* now¦325473, you¦325475 should definitely \add ≈be aware¦325475\add* that¦325476 you'll¦325480 die¦325480 from \add ≈war\add*, famine¦325478, and¦325479 \add ≈deadly diseases\add* where¦325482 you¦325483 all wanted¦325483 to¦325484 go¦325484 and \add ≈live¦325485 as foreigners\add*.
\c 43
