\v 2 Hoshayah's¦325521 son Azaryah¦325518, Kareah's¦325525 son Yohanan¦325522, and¦325526 all¦325526 the¦325529 arrogant¦325529 men¦325528 told¦325530 Yirmeyah¦325533, “You're¦325535 \add ≈lying\add* \add to us\add*. Our¦325540 god¦325540 Yahweh¦325539 didn't¦325537 send¦325538 you¦325538 to¦325541 \add ≈tell¦325541 us\add* not¦325542 to go¦325544 \add and\add* live¦325546 in Egypt¦325545.
