\v 4 \add ≈So¦325569\add* Kareah's¦325575 son¦325573 Yohanan¦325572, all¦325576 the¦325578 army¦325579 officers, and¦325580 all¦325580 \add the rest of\add* the¦325582 people¦325582, refused to¦325583 \add ≈take notice of¦325583 Yahweh's¦325584 instructions\add* to¦325585 \add remain\add* living in¦325586 the Yehudah¦325587 \add ≈region¦325586\add*.
